---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Stadium Ceiling Maintenance & Construction — ARCLIFT"
  description="Crawler under-ceiling platforms for stadium roof access: acoustic panel installation, rigging, lighting grid work. 20m–35m reach."
  transparentNav={false}
>

  <section class="hero-banner">
    <div class="overline">Stadium & Arena</div>
    <h1>STADIUM CEILING SOLUTIONS</h1>
    <p>Large-span steel structures, acoustic panel installation, rigging access, and lighting maintenance.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <div style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;">
      <h2 style="font-size:28px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:20px;">Why Stadiums Choose ARCLIFT</h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:#475569;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">Modern stadiums present unique ceiling access challenges. Roof spans of 100m+ sit 25m–70m above the field. Acoustic panels, lighting grids, rigging points, and HVAC systems all need installation and periodic maintenance — but scaffolding from the field level costs millions in lost event revenue and pitch damage.</p>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:#475569;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">The ARC-F series crawls directly onto the seating tiers or concourse deck, deploys its platform to the working height, and travels along the roof structure — without ever touching the pitch. A single ARC-F35 can cover the same ceiling area in one week that would take scaffolding crews a month.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec sec--gray">
    <div class="sec__header reveal">
      <div class="sec__overline">Recommended Models</div>
      <h2 class="sec__title">FOR STADIUM WORK</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="padding:32px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;">
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">ARC-F35 — Flagship</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:20px;">For the tallest stadium roofs (30m+). 12m×8m platform covers massive ceiling sections per deployment. 3T load handles heavy acoustic panels and lighting arrays.</p>
        <a href="/products/arc-f35-crawler-ceiling-platform/" class="btn btn--outline-blue">View Model →</a>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:32px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;">
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">ARC-F31 — High-Reach</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:20px;">Balanced reach and maneuverability for typical arena roofs (25m–31m). Lighter than 35M, faster repositioning between bays. Ideal for seasonal maintenance cycles.</p>
        <a href="/products/arc-f31-crawler-ceiling-platform/" class="btn btn--outline-blue">View Model →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <h2>PLANNING STADIUM CEILING WORK?</h2>
    <p>Tell us your roof height and access constraints — we'll spec the right ARC configuration.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn--white">Get a Project Assessment →</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
